+---
+id: task-003-make-applypatch-conform-to-rfc-6902
+type: task
+title: "Make applyPatch conform to RFC 6902"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Review `applyPatch` against RFC 6902 and fix every divergence. Found by the review:
+
+- Values that are not JSON (NaN, Infinity, Date, Map, class instances) were accepted in the document or in
+  a patch `value` (NaN silently became `null`); they must be rejected.
+- `replace` removed and re-added the member, moving it to the end of the object; it must replace in place.
+
+Tests in `src/index.test.ts` (red first for each).
